  // (7) ⛔ #a-capital-state-keeps-a-victory-point — a capital state whose last victory point this erase drowned (Rio, 10980, is BRA's
  // 500's only one), and whether the drowned province held its only hub, which (3) just removed: NAMED, for the page to give it one
  // once the Save's last write has landed (/api/map/keep-capitals; capitalsThisClickTakesFrom says why not here). Asked of the map as
  // it was before the erase.
  let capitalsToKeep = null;
