    // ⛔ #a-strait-costs-more-than-a-border — (i) A STRAIT IS TAKEN ONLY WHERE NO DRY WAY JOINS ITS TWO SHORES, AND COSTS TWO STEPS AND
    // ITS WATER MORE THAN A BORDER. A strait cost what a border did, so the search hopped over water wherever that was a province
