    // rail hops further; 5 victory points gain the rail and 2 of the 631 it ran through lose it — TEST 38's Digaleis (state 194, VP 3 in
    // province 6090) and Thagreiduv (state 626, VP 5 in 3009), each on the rail only by a loop (h) that now waits for a through-route 12%
    // over water on it — in 157, four provinces along Digaleis's loop, and in 9094, two along Thagreiduv's (disclosed: a loop is not a town's way in, and waiting is what (h) does). On the base game's own hubs 27 -> 12 (0.45% -> 0.20%) and on Millennium Dawn's 32 -> 19 (0.45% ->
    // 0.27%), the same hubs and capitals on the rail, 1 of the 747 and 1 of the 1,773 victory points the rail ran through off it, 1 and
