    + " will not write into the base game or another mod, so every province it makes has to keep the shape the"
    + " OCEAN had. Turning " + c.adding.toLocaleString() + " sea provinces into land is not " + c.adding.toLocaleString()
    + " provinces' worth of land: a sea province on this map averages " + n(c.meanSeaPx) + " pixels against a land"
    + " province's " + n(c.meanLandPx) + ", so this would add about " + c.addPx.toLocaleString() + " — "
    + times.toFixed(1) + "× " + c.smallestContinent + " (" + c.smallestContinentPx.toLocaleString() + " pixels over "
    + c.smallestContinentProvinces.toLocaleString() + " provinces), the smallest continent on this map"
    + (c.alreadyPx ? ", on top of the " + c.alreadyPx.toLocaleString() + " pixels your mod has already taken out of that ocean" : "")
    + ". " + room + " Past that you are not adding land to this world, you are replacing it, and a world needs"
    + " shapes of its own: copy that provinces.bmp into your mod's map/ folder first (or paint anything on the"
    + " map, which does it for you) and there is no limit.";
