// than every shipping map. The Sahara is one desert and the Alps are one range.
//
// ⭐ WHAT DECIDES WHICH PATCH: HEIGHT, measured on vanilla over every land province (mean heightmap value
// under its pixels, mean hops to the nearest sea province):
//
//     plains  mean h 102.9, 5.29 hops     mountain mean h 131.8, 4.37 hops
//     forest  mean h 105.3, 5.62          hills    mean h 116.1, 4.63
