  // far too loose. A new island dropped into an ocean that already has ports elsewhere on its real coastline
  // counted as covered, because it merely TOUCHES a sea that some other state's port points at. HOI4 asks a
  // much narrower question, per province: is there a port whose state matches and which sits on this
  // province? Measured on the owner's own launch, provinces 9 and 631 were skipped by the loose test while
  // the game reported both as "coastal but has no port … will likely crash".
  //
  // ⚠️ The position mapping is y = H - 1 - z, established from vanilla's own 2,362 rows: it lands 2,306 of
