  // So a strategic building vanishes from the game with nothing but a log line to say so.
  //
  // One edit does it wholesale. Turning a single big OPEN-OCEAN province into land can landlock every coast
  // that touched it: on the owner's mod, making provinces 2918 and 2942 into land left ELEVEN provinces
  // scattered across the world still saying `coastal = true` with no water beside them, because 2942 was the
  // only sea neighbour each of them had.
  //
  // ⚠️ The rule is honest — the invariant holds almost perfectly in shipping content. Land provinces marked
  // coastal whose bitmap gives them no sea: vanilla 0 of 2,362, Millennium Dawn 0 of 2,750, Old World Blues
  // 0 of 4,421, and 2 of 2,753 in one workshop mod. Two exceptions in 12,286 provinces.
