  // ⛔ #a-coast-keeps-the-port-the-click-re-keys — …AND A COAST WHOSE OWN PORT ROW STANDS ON IT, KEYED TO ANOTHER STATE, HAS THAT ROW
  // RE-KEYED, NOT A SECOND ONE ADDED. The game ignores such a row ("not within specified state"), so the rule (the dry run above) names
  // the province; but the repair is the re-key fixBuildingsTxtPlacement makes at the end of the click (rehomesTheModOwns, the list it
