  // Auto-fix ×2). Nova called it 3 problems, 1 error, 0 fatal, and HOI4 LOADED IT — main menu, 1936 game,
  // no MAP_ERROR. Then he looked at it: "the world looked super weird … it was still the same world but
  // full of holes … full of weird things that looked like glass." Measured against that installed mod and
  // the installed game, 13,414 rows each:
  //
  //     vanilla map/definition.csv    10,155 land ·  3,133 sea · 126 lake
  //     the mod's map/definition.csv   4,655 land ·  8,633 sea · 126 lake
