  // link only between neighbours: any other is dropped without a word, so no track is drawn and no supply carried there. Only the
  // ones more than 8 apart were said. Measured through this rule over every railway on vanilla and the seven installed Workshop maps
  // (10-21): vanilla, Rise of Nations and The Divided Front 0; Old World Blues 132, Novum Vexillum 16, Road to 56 10, Millennium
  // Dawn 3, Hearts of Minecraft 2 (and 1 more than 8 apart) — each a real gap in that map, and every one of them launches, so a
  // WARNING, never fatal. A pair already said as too far is not said twice.
  const anyRow = new Map();
