  // "Where the layer below had sea there or beside it" (a fleet) and "where the layer below had land" (a division) keep a mod from
  // being blamed for what it inherits broken. They also let through every berth the mod's OWN file gives, and Nova's repairs write
  // exactly those: a fleet re-berthed at a harbour on a base-game inland province the new land made coastal, or on a piece cut out
