  // its colour says. On a map built over the one below (Nova's worlds, MD, R56, RoN, NV) it is; Old World Blues ships its own
  // definition.csv, its cartel_fuerte berth 10730 is not vanilla's coastal 10730, and that shape is its own to answer for. (By its
  // 2026-10-28 download that berth is its coastal 2255; the rule stands on the shape, not on that one file.)
