/** #an-air-wing-based-in-a-state-that-is-gone — the air wings the started orders of battle base in a state the map does not have,
 *  that the MOD answers for: a wing in its own order-of-battle file, or in a state the layers below have and the mod's states took
 *  away. With nothing below (the base game itself, or a mod replacing history/states) every such wing is the mod's own. Each wing
 *  carries `reason`: "own-file" | "removed" | "nothing-below". Returns { wings, judgedAgainstBelow }. */
