  // judged at that bookmark's date, on BOTH sides: who controls its state here (the state file that loads, read as the game reads its
  // dated blocks) and who controlled the state below. Asked of the undated owner, vanilla's 1939 JAP wings in 597 and 591 — Chinese,
  // Japanese-held from 1938.10.25 — were excused on a generated world that kept those ids Chinese (no dated block is written there),
