/** #a-strategic-location-the-game-refuses — common/strategic_locations, merged: `<location> → { <building>: extra levels }`.
 *  A strategic location is a named bundle of EXTRA province-building max levels (documentation.md in that folder);
 *  `strategic_province_location = { natural_harbor = 12140 }` hands one to a province. Built once per model, and only
 *  when a state actually names one — a map with none pays nothing. */
